      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds incredibly exhausting to feel so disconnected from your own life and purpose. That feeling of being a replaceable cog in a large machine is a heavy weight to carry every day. Please know that even if the world feels indifferent, your internal experiences and feelings are incredibly real and matter. If this feeling of emptiness persists, reaching out to a mental health professional can provide you with a supportive space to explore these deep feelings.",
