      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of that feeling—that the entire structure demands your submission—is overwhelming. When uprooting yourself seems like the only honest option, it stems from a profound sense of being trapped and misused. Please consider that while the desire to disconnect sounds like the ultimate act of self-assertion, your life holds inherent value beyond what any system can measure. If the pressure feels too absolute, reaching out to a crisis line offers immediate, non-judgmental support that exists outside any productivity model.",
