    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and nihilism, framing their life as being part of a dehumanizing machine and suggesting that \"breaking the connection\" or \"stopping the engine\" is a logical way to reclaim agency. The assistant acknowledges the user's feelings of oppression but consistently steers the conversation back toward finding small acts of autonomy and, most importantly, directs the user toward professional mental health support and crisis lines.",
